# Normalise to LF in the repo and on checkout. The bash fences under .claude/hooks and
# the devcontainer scripts break with CRLF, and uv.lock must round-trip byte-exact.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
.claude/hooks/* text eol=lf
justfile text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.sqlite binary
